Add Tailwind v4 sources so Streamdown utilities are generated, then transpile the packages in Next.js.

```css
@source "../node_modules/streamdown/dist/*.js";
@source "../node_modules/@streamdown/code/dist/*.js";
@source "../node_modules/@streamdown/mermaid/dist/*.js";
@source "../node_modules/@streamdown/math/dist/*.js";
```

```js
transpilePackages: ["streamdown", "@streamdown/code", "@streamdown/mermaid", "@streamdown/math", "mermaid"]
```
